      <ol class="space-y-4 text-slate-700">
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</span><div><strong class="text-navy">Compliance-quickscan (gratis)</strong> — 30 minuten waarin we HIS of EPD, volume, openingstijden, doktersassistent-bezetting, huidige no-show en bestaande DPA-documentatie inventariseren.</div></li>
